<div id="Methodology" class="tabcontent">
  <h1>METHODOLOGY</h1>
  <!-- Initial content for the website-->
  <h2>Problem statement</h2><p>How do the presence and condition of allotments relate to the Scottish Index of Multiple Deprivation (SIMD) Health Index across Edinburgh?</p>
  <h2>Background</h2><p>Urban allotments provide space for growing food, outdoor activity and social connection. This project examines whether allotment presence and environmental condition are associated with local health indicators, </p>
  <h2>Methodology</h2><p>Compare 10 allotment areas with 10 selected comparison areas without allotments. Combine council allotment data, field observations and SIMD data-zone health measures. A 300 m buffer is proposed around each study area</p>
